    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d756">

                <pb facs="0795" n="745" xml:id="pg745"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1894-10-04"><hi rendition="#italic">October
                                4, 1894</hi></date>. (Received October 22.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 319.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge your
                    telegram of the 3d instant, in reference to native teachers in American schools
                    in Turkey, and the capricious arrest of naturalized Americans.</p>
                <p>I hope to succeed in enforcing your views. * * *</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
